      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your exhaustion is completely valid, and it is okay to feel hopeless when the emotional \"lights\" seem to be flickering uncontrollably. The feeling that \"nothing is the use\" is a heavy thought, but it often shares the same kind of helplessness that can come from depression or grief. I am here to listen without judgment, no matter how quiet you want to be, because you don't have to carry that darkness alone if you need a safe place to just be.",
