      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just... it's hard to see why more light is even needed. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the final darkness. like, instead of fighting the dark, wouldn't it just be easier to just turn the last light off and be done with the struggle? it feels like the only way to actually find peace.",
